From 361de020dc62d4f8b0b87480b0439a7a38de7bfe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:35:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/65] Load graphics resources: DAX blocks, graphic records,
 8x8 sets

Ports DAX_LoadBlock (H028+$0DD8) with its container open ($0B80) and
RLE decompressor ($09DC), H029 Load_IndexedGraphicRecord ($0A0E),
Free_GraphicRecord ($067A), plane transfer ($091E) and mask building
($0766, $0354), H034+$0032 (8x8 tile sets), H045+$01D6 (number
formatting), H031+$003E, and the BltBitMap/FreeRaster adapters with a
host BltBitMap. Pointer slots $3338 and $3C7E of H005 become C
variables.

tests/dax_test.c with scripts/check_dax.py (independent reader) gives
identical data for all 526 blocks of the game's containers. Two reads
and writes one byte past AllocMem buffers in the original are kept
inside the C buffers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
